        "original_id": "149af3fb-ebf6-5a5c-83d1-fd701c650b89",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Rash, Patrick Dempsey, Amanda Peterson, Hayden Panettiere, Solange Knowles\n- Films: The Buddy Holly Story, Can't Buy Me Love, Queens Logic, Bring It On: All or Nothing\n- Roles: film director, producer, actors\n- Places: Tucson, Arizona\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Rash is an American film director and producer best known for directing The Buddy Holly Story, Can't Buy Me Love, and Queens Logic.\n- Can't Buy Me Love is a 1987 American teen romantic comedy film starring Patrick Dempsey and Amanda Peterson.\n- Can't Buy Me Love is about a high school nerd in Tucson, Arizona who pays a cheerleader $1,000 to pretend to be his girlfriend for a month.\n- Bring It On: All or Nothing, previously known as Bring It On Yet Again, is a 2006 cheerleading comedy film directed by Steve Rash.\n- Bring It On: All or Nothing stars Hayden Panettiere and Solange Knowles.",
